---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
import portada from '../assets/logo/portada-735x420.jpg';
import perfil from '../assets/logo/perfil-1024.jpg';
---

<section
  id="sobre"
  aria-label="Sobre nosotros"
  class="bg-gradient-to-b from-background via-primary/25 to-background px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="font-hand text-2xl text-accent">conocenos · hecho con amor 💕</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">Sobre nosotros</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
        Un emprendimiento de repostería 100% casera, hecho con amor en Burzaco, PBA.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-14">
      <div>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-1 font-display text-2xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-text sm:text-[1.65rem]">
          «Detalles dulces para regalar, sorprender o mimarte 💕»
        </p>

        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          En {siteConfig.name} hacemos desayunos, meriendas, tartas 100% caseras y cajitas
          personalizadas, además de combos para mate. Todo se arma con amor, se pide por
          WhatsApp y llega a la zona de Burzaco, PBA.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-5 font-hand text-2xl text-accent">
          ¡Hacemos todo con amor! 💕
        </p>

        <ul class="reveal reveal-delay-4 mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-accent/20 bg-surface/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-text/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4 text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 21s-6.7-4.35-9.33-8.11C.6 9.8 2.1 5.5 5.6 5.5c2 0 3.2 1.2 4.4 2.8 1.2-1.6 2.4-2.8 4.4-2.8 3.5 0 5 4.3 2.93 7.39C18.7 16.65 12 21 12 21z" />
            </svg>
            100% casero
          </li>
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-accent/20 bg-surface/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-text/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4 text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-8.5 8.5c-1 0-1.95-.16-2.83-.47L4 21l1.47-3.67A8.38 8.38 0 1 1 21 11.5z" />
            </svg>
            Pedidos por WhatsApp
          </li>
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-accent/20 bg-surface/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-text/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4 text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
            </svg>
            Burzaco, PBA
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 relative mx-auto mt-2 w-full max-w-md lg:mt-0 lg:max-w-none">
        <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] shadow-xl shadow-text/15 ring-4 ring-surface">
          <img
            src={portada.src}
            alt="Portada de Dulce & Punto con sus dulces caseros"
            width={735}
            height={420}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
          />
        </figure>

        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-2 sm:-left-6">
          <span class="block overflow-hidden rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-text/15 ring-4 ring-surface">
            <img
              src={perfil.src}
              alt="Logo circular de Dulce & Punto"
              width={1024}
              height={1024}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="h-24 w-24 rounded-full object-cover lg:h-28 lg:w-28"
            />
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute -top-5 right-2 lg:-top-7 lg:right-0">
          <div class="animate-float">
            <div class="flex h-24 w-24 -rotate-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-center shadow-lg shadow-text/15 ring-2 ring-white lg:h-28 lg:w-28">
              <span class="font-hand text-[1.35rem] leading-tight text-text">hecho<br />con amor</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

